      "rationale": "The quote function hashes the concatenation of tenant, sku, and currency, so the price depends on all three fields. Omitting any field would cause distinct queries with different omitted-field values to share the same cache key while producing different prices, leading to incorrect quotes. To guarantee zero incorrect quotes, the cache key must include every field that influences the quote. The workload varies tenant (3 values), currency (2 values), and sku (5 values), yielding 30 unique combinations. Caching on all three fields results in exactly 30 reference lookups (one per unique key) with subsequent hits, which is optimal under the zero-error constraint."
